\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 If you were raised religious, but deconstructed, there\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s a very good chance we are compatible. \line I do have a healthy respect for spirituality; reality is very weird.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Okay, I have officially reached the "maybe my person is hiding somewhere on Reddit" stage of dating, so here we are lol.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I'm 31 and live near Myrtle Beach, South Carolina. I'm a widowed mom to two-year-old twins, a boy and a girl, and l also have a black Lab mix who is basically my third child. My life can be chaotic, but it is also full of love, snacks, toddler nonsense, dog hair, and someone always needing something from me.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I'm 5'4", curvy/plus-size, mixed Black and white, with blue eyes, short dark curly hair, and glasses. I'm happy to share a picture privately once we've spoken a little because attraction matters, but I'm not trying to lead with a full photoshoot for the men of Reddit lol.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Personality-wise, I'm affectionate, sensitive, sarcastic, a little awkward, and probably too honest once I feel comfortable. I can be introverted and definitely prefer being at home with someone I love over going out to crowded bars every weekend. I like meaningful conversations, laughing over stupid things, sending random thoughts throughout the day, and feeling like the person I'm talking to actually wants to know me.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0 Some of the things I'm into:}{\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \line \bullet  Thrifting, consignment stores, flea markets, and finding weird vintage things I absolutely do not need\line \bullet  Metaphysical shops, crystals, astrology, spirituality, and anything slightly mysterious\line \bullet  Indie horror games and watching video-game playthroughs\line \bullet  Games like Persona, Dragon Age, and Vampire: The Masquerade - Bloodlines\line \bullet  Shows like The X-Files and Twin Peaks\line \bullet  Horror, mysteries, weird internet rabbit holes, and conversations that go in completely unexpected directions\line \bullet  Staying home, getting comfortable, ordering food, and watching something together while pretending we're going to stay awake}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I'm looking for a genuine relationship with someone who is emotionally available and interested in building something meaningful. I'm not looking for casual dating, an undefined situationship, or a connection that never progresses beyond messaging. I want something intentional, monogamous, attectionate, emotionally safe, and serious.\~}{\f1\fs24\b1\i0 I don't do long distance so please be near SC, NC, or GA.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I'm most attracted to men who are kind, confident, protective, family oriented, loyal, emotionally mature, and comfortable taking initiative. I value clear communication, consistency, affection, and someone whose actions match his words. I want a relationship where both people feel respected, appreciated, secure, and genuinely cared about.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Hey! I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m a 31-year-old woman from Kentucky, and I\u8217\'92m hoping to meet someone who\u8217\'92s genuinely looking for a serious relationship.\line I\u8217\'92m a nurse, a big dog person, and I\u8217\'92m open to relocating for the right person. I\u8217\'92m at a point in life where I\u8217\'92d rather build something meaningful with someone than waste time with games or casual situations.\line Looking for someone kind, loyal, emotionally mature, and ready for a real relationship. Bonus points if you love dogs.\line I\u8217\'92m open to getting to know someone from anywhere, so distance isn\u8217\'92t necessarily a dealbreaker.\line If you\u8217\'92re also looking for something serious, tell me a little about yourself and let\u8217\'92s see where it goes. If you\u8217\'92ve read this far tell me your comfort show or movie and what you\u8217\'92d pick for your death row meal. }
\par\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I'm nurturing and protective by nature, and I'm looking to build a relationship that's a safe harbour, free of judgement, a place for self-improvement and growth for the both of us. I'm not looking to play games, or to fill a temporary boredom, I'm looking for something honest and real.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 As for my specs, I'm 175 cm/5'9'', pale, blue-eyed, blonde, pretty strong, and have a little bit of a dad bod (working on it). I also have rosacea, so my face can get a little rosy sometimes. I like to think that I'm compact, and that if I was an ipod, I would be an ipod Nano. I'm straight and strictly monogamous.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I'm looking to take things slow and see what develops, I'm not here to play mind games or cure someone's boredom. I'm looking for something honest and real. I know this may be deeper than what most are after - but I'm sure you're out there somewhere!}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Should we be a good match, expect calls about deep topics or absolutely nothing, silly pictures on snapchat, bedtime phone calls (if that's your thing) watching shows and movies, playing games, that I check up on you frequently, and that I'm your biggest cheerleader.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0 Who are you?}{\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \line You're ideally between 25-35 years old, and if you're not in Norway, you're open to a LDR with meetups until we're able to close the gap. You're also interested in a long-term relationship built on trust, love and honesty. What you look like isn't super important to me, emotional connection is what I'm after.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 If you want to see if we click, feel free to shoot me a DM telling me a bit about yourself.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Either way, I wish you the best of luck finding your person!}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Hi, and thanks for stopping by.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m a 28-year-old Florida woman with a mixed cultural background that includes Black, Asian, and European heritage. I\u8217\'92m Black-presenting, so if that\u8217\'92s not your preference, no worries.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m at a point in life where I\u8217\'92m looking for something meaningful, lasting, and grounded in real compatibility. I value faith, loyalty, emotional maturity, honesty, and mutual respect, and I\u8217\'92d love to find someone who feels similarly about building a strong relationship and eventually a family together.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A few things that matter to me are good communication, consistency, kindness, and being able to genuinely enjoy each other\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s company. I also care deeply about family and appreciate people who are respectful toward the important people in my life.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b1\i1 What I\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2\uc1\u8217\'92m Looking For:}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \bullet  Monogamous and emotionally mature\line \bullet  Christian and serious about faith\line \bullet  Honest, respectful, and intentional\line \bullet  Good communicator who doesn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t ghost\line \bullet  Family-oriented and grounded\line \bullet  Someone who enjoys humor and can laugh easily\line \bullet  Health-conscious or working toward self-improvement\line \bullet  No smoking or drug use\line \bullet  Between 24\endash 56\line \bullet  White or East Asian}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A Little About Me:}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m introspective, creative, affectionate, and adventurous. I enjoy nature, history, road trips, discovering new places, and learning random interesting things. I love both deep conversations and playful humor.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 In my free time, I enjoy gaming (especially RPGs, FPS games, and simulation games), journaling, singing, skincare, listening to rock and heavy metal, and relaxing outdoors with a warm drink.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I also have a background in healthcare and interests in medical laboratory science and related fields. My faith keeps me grounded, and I try to approach life with gratitude, resilience, and authenticity.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 If you\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92re looking for a serious relationship built on trust, faith, respect, and genuine connection, feel free to send a thoughtful introduction.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Please don\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t message me if you have the tendency to block or ghost and can\u8217\'92t conduct a civil conversation.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 between building my life, working, making plans, overthinking everything, laughing at things I probably shouldn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t, and trying to figure out what the hell I\u8217\'92m doing with my life\u8230\'85 I realised I genuinely want love.\line Not just someone to text all day.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I want my person.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Someone I can tell the stupid little details of my day to. Someone who will call me just because they know I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m probably awake. Someone who wants to experience life with me rather than just have a relationship in theory.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I want the ordinary stuff too. Grocery shopping together. Cooking badly and blaming each other. Random Sunday drives. Travelling somewhere neither of us has been. Sitting quietly in the same room doing completely different things. Knowing when the other person needs space and when they actually need a hug.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m attracted to men who are emotionally intelligent, kind, curious and confident without needing to prove they\u8217\'92re the smartest or toughest person in the room. I like a man who has his own life and ambitions but still makes room for someone else in it.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 And yes, I have a thing for white men. \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u55357\'3F\u56834\'3F I\u8217\'92m not going to pretend I don\u8217\'92t. There\u8217\'92s something about a certain kind of white man that gets me; especially the emotionally open, slightly nerdy, intelligent ones who can talk about absolutely everything and somehow make me laugh at 2am.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 But attraction only gets you through the door.\line I care much more about how you treat people. How you communicate when you\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92re annoyed. Whether you can apologise without turning it into a courtroom case. Whether you\u8217\'92re affectionate. Whether you\u8217\'92re capable of being vulnerable without disappearing afterwards.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m not looking for perfection. I actually find perfection boring.\line I want someone real. Someone who has lived a little. Someone who has stories, weird habits, opinions, dreams, baggage they\u8217\'92re actually willing to deal with, and a sense of humour.Im also not looking for a pen pal.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 If we click, I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92d rather eventually hear your voice, see your face, and find out whether the chemistry survives outside a Reddit inbox.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I don\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t know if this will lead anywhere. Maybe I\u8217\'92ll meet someone wonderful. Maybe I\u8217\'92ll get 47 messages from men who think \u8220\'93hey\u8221\'94 constitutes an opening line. \u55357\'3F\u56834\'3F\line Either way, I figured I\u8217\'92d try.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 So\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8230\'85 if you\u8217\'92re a kind, emotionally available man who is genuinely looking for something meaningful, tell me about yourself. Not your r\u233\'E9sum\u233\'E9. Tell me something that would make me want to know you.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b1 If you\loch\af3\hich\af3\dbch\af3\uc1\u8217\'92ve ever been told you\u8217\'92re \u8220\'93too clingy,\u8221\'94 I have some good news for you.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 might actually be my type.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 You}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92ve never really understood why wanting to talk to someone you like is considered a red flag. If I\u8217\'92m into you, I\~}{\f0\fs24\b0\i1 want}{\f0\fs24\b0 \~to hear from you. I want the random \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93look at this\u8221\'94 messages, the unnecessary updates about your day, the voice notes that somehow turn into podcasts, the memes that make absolutely no sense out of context, and the occasional \u8220\'93I miss you\u8221\'94 even though we talked 30 minutes ago.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Basically, I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m looking for someone who enjoys\~}{\f0\fs24\b1 a slightly unreasonable amount of attention.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 My weekdays are usually pretty busy with work, but once I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m done, I\u8217\'92m very much a \u8220\'93why are we not talking right now?\u8221\'94 kind of person.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Give me someone who gets excited when my name pops up on her phone and I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92ll happily return the favor.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I like flirting. A lot.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I like teasing someone until she tells me to shut up, then immediately sending another message.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I like random selfies.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I like \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93call me\u8221\'94 texts with absolutely zero context.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I like hearing about the tiny insignificant thing that happened in your day because, somehow, those are usually the conversations I end up remembering.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 And if you get a\~}{\f0\fs24\b0\i1 little}{\f0\fs24\b0 \~possessive when someone else has my attention?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m not saying I\u8217\'92ll encourage it...}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8230\'85but I\u8217\'92m definitely going to find it cute.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m not looking to speedrun a relationship or force some \u8220\'93where is this going?\u8221\'94 conversation after three days. I\u8217\'92d rather meet someone, click naturally, flirt irresponsibly, make each other laugh, become each other\u8217\'92s favorite person to bother, and see where it goes.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b1 A little about me:}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m a tech guy, which means I spend a questionable amount of my life staring at screens. Fortunately, I try to compensate by actually leaving the house.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Gym keeps me sane. I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m always down for volleyball or soccer. Long drives with a good playlist are basically therapy. I\u8217\'92m a huge F1 fan, so if you understand the specific pain of confidently saying\~}{\f0\fs24\b0\i1 \loch\af4\hich\af4\dbch\af4\uc1\u8220\'93surely Ferrari has this one\u8221\'94}{\f0\fs24\b0 \~and immediately regretting it, we already have something to bond over.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I love traveling too. Beaches, mountains, cold weather, random cities I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92ve never heard of before \hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0  I\u8217\'92m pretty easy to convince as long as the company is good.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 When I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m home, there\u8217\'92s a decent chance I\u8217\'92m gaming, watching some thriller/horror/mystery/action series, or saving memes that were clearly created specifically for your future DMs.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Personality-wise, I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m pretty easygoing, sarcastic, affectionate, and probably slightly too good at turning a normal conversation into absolute nonsense.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 But I also love those conversations that unexpectedly get deep at 2 AM.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 You know the ones.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 One minute we\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92re arguing about which snack is objectively superior, and somehow 20 minutes later we\u8217\'92re talking about childhood, relationships, dreams, fears, and where we want our lives to go.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b1 That\loch\af3\hich\af3\dbch\af3\uc1\u8217\'92s the kind of connection I\u8217\'92m looking for.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Someone who wants to become my favorite notification.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Someone who randomly sends me a picture because she felt cute.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Someone who says \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93stay on the phone\u8221\'94 even when neither of us is actually talking.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Someone who asks what I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m doing despite knowing there\u8217\'92s a 70% chance the answer is \u8220\'93trying to figure out what I want to eat.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Someone who isn't afraid of being a little too much.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Because honestly?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b1 I\loch\af3\hich\af3\dbch\af3\uc1\u8217\'92d rather have too much of someone than barely enough.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 So if you\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92re into constant texting, shameless flirting, playful jealousy, stupid amounts of attention, late-night conversations, random calls, and the possibility of accidentally becoming ridiculously attached to each other...}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Come say hi.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 And please don't send me a boring \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93hey.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Give me something chaotic.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Flirt with me.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Ask me an unreasonably specific question.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Tell me your most controversial opinion.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Send me your worst pickup line.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Or just say something that makes me wonder what exactly I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92ve gotten myself into.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b1 Bonus points if your first message makes me smile at my phone like an idiot.}}